==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|хотѣ́ть||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|хотѣти}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*xotěti}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|хоте́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-хотеть.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|хоте́ть|impf|pf=захоте́ть|vn=хоте́ние}}

# to [[want]], to [[desire]] {{+obj|ru|gen/acc/inf/:что́бы(past-cl)}}

====Usage notes====
* The form {{m|ru|хотя́}} has been lexicalized with the meaning "although", and is no longer used as an adverbial participle. Instead the [[suppletive]] form {{m|ru|жела́я}} is used.

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|irreg|хоте́ть|pradp=жела́я}}

